Description: Use when working through building an AI-native product or startup with Anthropic's Founder's Playbook (OPC) methodology — validating whether an idea is worth building (Idea), deciding what to build first (MVP), earning the right to grow (Launch), or scaling into a durable business (Scale). 分阶段陪跑:定位当前阶段 → 明确该阶段要回答的引导问题和退出标准 → 用该阶段的可复用提示词逐步推进工作 → 全程结构化 devil's advocate。适用于验证想法、梳理需求、决定"该不该做/先做什么"、防止"用 AI 高速为一个错误前提疯狂建造"。
