Proposed (17.5s): Use when someone is building or thinking about building a product, app, startup, or business idea and wants a thinking partner to pressure-test decisions — not just execute. Trigger for: "我有个想法/想做个产品,值不值得做?"、把一个痛点打磨成可验证的假设、判断有没有 product-market fit(而非自我感觉良好)、"该继续加功能还是先想别的/先做什么"、上线后没起色不知下一步、"想开始做增长/扩张该从哪下手"、以及"用最狠的角度反驳我这个想法,别顺着我说 / 帮我挑毛病"。也用于任何创业/产品阶段的迷茫:值不值得做、先做什么、配不配增长、能不能规模化。

Guides them stage by stage (Idea → MVP → Launch → Scale) using Anthropic's Founder's Playbook: locate the current stage, name what must be true to advance, and act as a structured devil's advocate so they don't build fast on a wrong premise.

Do NOT use for ordinary coding, refactoring, docs, data viz, or explaining a business concept academically.

